// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Graham Easton 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P33614748" "Graham Easton"
// ProfessionString :
"P772411489" "Museum Curator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1288075040" "Graham Easton is one of Paragon City's foremost art enthusiasts, and has financed numerous local artists and projects in the past decade. He is currently working as the curator for the recently-opened Paragon Asian Art Museum. He is beginning to realize it is a position of considerably greater stress than he originally anticipated."
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
// HelloString :
"P3743609037" "EEEK!<br><br>Oh, i-it's you, {HeroName}. What can I do for you?"
// HelloString :
"P3158663234" "Let's hurry this up, {HeroName}. I am a <i>very</i> busy man."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1664678164" "While I'm sure most are impressed with your impeccable fashion sense, I'm afraid I'm a man of more... <i>discerning</i> tastes. So unless you're here on official business, I would ask that you leave me in peace."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P849978900" "Listen, {HeroName}... I really respect you, and I'm grateful for the things you've done for me. I really am!<br><br>It's just... it seems like trouble tends to follow you around. I would... I would prefer it if you didn't visit the museum anymore. No hard feelings, ok?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P721128551" "I can't believe this. I have a deadline to meet, my museum is in <i>danger</i>, and now you're too busy to help?<br><br>Honestly, {HeroName}, how important could your other tasks possibly be?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3699927479" "Uh... no offense, {HeroName}. I was hoping I could work with someone more... established. I do hope you understand."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2256880680" "The only reason I would say this to you is if an error occurred... and it appears one has. Please file a bug report so that someone can fix it right away."
// IntroString :
"P2049933865" "Introduction"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2066226271" "Intro accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2826310298" "Intro send off"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1060484728" "Introduce one contact"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3673397332" "Introduce two contacts"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NoFlashback Text :
"P1404040293" "<color orange>A middle-aged man is looking down alleyways nervously, clearly expecting something dangerous. When he finally notices you, he lets out a yelp and jumps back.</color><br><br><b>GAH!</b> Oh, you nearly gave me a heart attack!<br><br>You're... {HeroName}, right? Oh thank goodness... give me a moment to catch my breath."
// Answer Text :
"P896253841" "Are you alright?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2540886914" "I'll be fine, {HeroName}.<br><br><color orange>The man calms himself somewhat, holding his hand to his chest as he catches his breath. He nods at you respectfully.</color><br><br>My name is Graham Easton; you may have heard of me. I'm fairly well-known in the art community around Paragon City. I apologize for my reaction to you just now. I'm just... jumpy lately, that's all.<br><br>But can you blame me? Those... those men! They <i>attacked</i> my museum, before it even <i>opened</i>! Can you <b><i>imagine</b></i>?"
// Answer Text :
"P633120877" "Your museum was attacked? By who?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3498140022" "<color orange>Graham waves his hand dismissively.</color><br><br>Ruffians wearing sedge hats and karate robes, I don't know who they were. Probably some disgruntled artists that didn't appreciate one of my articles.<br><br><color orange>Graham puffs himself up slightly, and dons a self-important smile.</color><br><br>Did I mention that I'm one of the foremost art critics in Paragon? I've got a syndicated column in the Paragon Painter newsletter, and I..."
// Answer Text :
"P3697132810" "Sedge hats and karate robes? Graham, it sounds like you were attacked by the Tsoo."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P827529668" "<color orange>Graham blinks at you, dumbfounded.</color><br><br>The... Tsoo? What is a Tsoo?"
// Answer Text :
"P3101677748" "...Nevermind. Just tell me what they took."
// Answer Text :
"P1091334346" "Fine, let's get started."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


