"P1415935792" "Montague Castanella"
// ProfessionString :
"P3789433318" "Member of the Midnight Squad"
// DescriptionString :
"P1330861843" "Beyond his interest in all matters arcane, Montague Castanella has a unique ability. He is unaffected by temporal shifts. Somehow, his brain can perceive alterations within a timeline. He did not realize he had this ability until Ouroboros arrived and begin adjusting the timeline to better prepare for a future attack.<br><br>However, this has also awakened him to other adjustments being made by groups other than Ouroboros.<br><br>He has taken the lead in recruiting heroes to join the Midnight Squad, believing that now, more than ever, their knowledge and expertise are needed to combat the Rikti as well as other threats."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1890569092" "Hello"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1694568991" "Very interesting.  Since I'm an Auto-Issue contact, you should never see my IDontKnowYouString."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1393323835" "Hello, {HeroName}. My name's <color deepskyblue>Montague Castanella</color>.  I'm a member of a group of people who have interest in matters of the occult and mystic arts.<br><br>Perhaps you've heard of our group. We're called <color deepskyblue>The Midnight Squad</color> and we have been around for some time. However, ever since the Rikti invasion, our numbers have been greatly depleted. It is my hope to change that."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1247929916" "For now, I have nothing more for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P231522646" "Please finish your other tasks before you ask to work with us."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4029777980" "You have done well, Midnighter.<br><br> I have an important task for you that is of the utmost secrecy. However, even though you are a member of the <color deepskyblue>Midnight Club</color>, I do not believe that you have the ability to handle this mission.  Yet. <color orange>Please come back to me when you're security level {level}</color>. Only then will I be able to grant you access to this mission."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// IntroString :
"P2959886201" "A man by the name of Montague wants to talk to you. I know very little about him; something tells me that's the way he likes it."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P313339986" "Speak with Montague Castanella."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3052707147" "Good luck."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2033832665" "There is someone who would like to met with you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1818465485" "There are some people who have been inquiring about you."
